DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/2026-10-23-football-match/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/V6xGtQsgVaxitq8Y8" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Allmend II & III, next to the Züri Fit calisthenics / street workout park</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Timon Fopp (<a class="link" href="mailto:timon.fopp@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">timon.fopp@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41783309888">+41783309888</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4fkls22YuAI-N17_7LjNYZOOb-6txq0gvTh12p2gpYm8sWw/viewform?usp=publish-editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration form</a>\n\n<p>It&rsquo;s match time! ⚽ <strong>CSSZ – Czech and Slovak Students in Zurich</strong> vs. <strong>Czech &amp; Slovak Union</strong> (<a class="link" href="https://www.instagram.com/czechslovakunion/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>) in a friendly football match at the Allmend in Zurich.</p> <h2 id="date--time">Date &amp; Time</h2> <p><strong>Thursday, October 22, 2026 at 17:00</strong></p> <h2 id="location">Location</h2> <p><strong>Allmend II &amp; III</strong> – the football pitches right next to the <strong>Züri Fit calisthenics / street workout park</strong>, just behind the Saalsporthalle and across from Sihlcity.</p> <h2 id="what-to-expect">What to Expect</h2> <ul> <li>⚽ <strong>Friendly match</strong> – CSSZ vs. Czech &amp; Slovak Union</li> <li>👟 <strong>All levels welcome</strong>, and <strong>women are very welcome</strong> to play!</li> <li>🍺 <strong>Beer, drinks and snacks included</strong></li> <li>👀 <strong>Spectators welcome!</strong> Not playing? Come watch, cheer and enjoy a beer with us</li> <li>🎉 Good company and a chance to meet the other Czech &amp; Slovak community in Zurich</li> </ul> <h2 id="getting-there">Getting There</h2> <p>From <strong>Zürich HB</strong>:</p>
